OL,3,ABritain is back and can be relied on as
OL,4,A'stable partner' in uncertain world,
OL,5,ABurnham tells MPs
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham is making a statement to
OL,8,FMPs as Parliament returns from
OL,9,Fconference recess - you can watch live
OL,10,Fabove
OL,12,FThe PM condemns Russian strikes on
OL,13,FUkraine, saying he welcomes President
OL,14,FTrump's announcement of an "energy
OL,15,Fceasefire"
OL,17,FBurnham says it would be a "dereliction
OL,18,Fof duty" to turn down a closer
OL,19,Frelationship with the EU - and a new
OL,20,Fdeal with the EU could boost growth and
OL,21,Ftackle illegal immigration
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
