OL,3,ABritain is back and can be relied on as
OL,4,A'stable partner' in uncertain world,
OL,5,ABurnham tells MPs
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe says Britain should set up a
OL,8,F"serious dialogue" about the future of
OL,9,Fthe relationship, and at every stage
OL,10,Fthe British public "will be the boss"
OL,12,FThe PM told the BBC two weeks ago it
OL,13,Fwas "possible" a future Labour
OL,14,Fmanifesto could promise a new
OL,15,Freferendum
OL,17,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch said
OL,18,Fat her party's conference last week it
OL,19,Fwas "a terrible idea" to "reopen the
OL,20,FBrexit debate"
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
