OL,3,AHealey faces #35bn Budget challenge to
OL,4,Ameet spending pledges, says think tank
OL,5,
OL,6,FChancellor John Healey faces having to
OL,7,Ffind #35bn to avoid cuts to public
OL,8,Fspending while meeting defence promises
OL,9,Fin his first Budget, an influential
OL,10,Fthink tank has warned.
OL,12,FThe Institute for Fiscal Studies (IFS)
OL,13,Fsaid that if the government wants to
OL,14,Fraise defence spending to 3% of
OL,15,Fnational income by 2030 and lift health
OL,16,Fspending without squeezing other
OL,17,Fdepartments, it will need a "top-up" of
OL,18,Fbillions of pounds.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
