OL,4,Ato import diesel from Russia
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe move has been criticised by some
OL,7,FRepublican and Democratic lawmakers,
OL,8,Fwho believe the deal violates US laws.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
